{"4930190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drive or Die", "steam_appid": 4930190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the horde behind you and asphalt in front, there's only one choice... DRIVE or DIE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it as far as you can gunnin', smashin' and draftin' your way through the dead, only to die yourself and do it again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your car, change your weapons, whatever it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>THE HIGHWAY BITES BACK</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/da6d3f44c628fca893834bda07795db0.poster.avif?t=1787688568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/da6d3f44c628fca893834bda07795db0.webm?t=1787688568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/da6d3f44c628fca893834bda07795db0.mp4?t=1787688568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The road's cluttered with dead and debris alike.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Both will kill ya as quick as a breath,</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Never take your eyes off 'em</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>DRAFT YOUR WAY TO HELL</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/2a2c503f632cf5bb7e250679a5e1ef98.poster.avif?t=1787688568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/2a2c503f632cf5bb7e250679a5e1ef98.webm?t=1787688568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/2a2c503f632cf5bb7e250679a5e1ef98.mp4?t=1787688568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Cards make nothin' the same. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Common, Rare, even Legendary if you're lucky enough...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(Maybe even some others too...)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>RACK UP THE BODY COUNT</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/914a1b6d18663350ff5c971396221f8c.poster.avif?t=1787688568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/914a1b6d18663350ff5c971396221f8c.webm?t=1787688568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/914a1b6d18663350ff5c971396221f8c.mp4?t=1787688568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every kill feeds the chain. Every chain feeds the grade.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>How long can you hold on?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i></i><br><br><strong><u>WHEN WILL YOU JOIN THE HORDE?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/e8c68d162a193ebf1c32ff87ce8b59da.avif?t=1787688568\" width=1512 height=944 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>We all will, eventually.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No one outruns the horde forever</i>.<i>..</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the horde behind you and asphalt in front, there's only one choice... DRIVE or DIE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it as far as you can gunnin', smashin' and draftin' your way through the dead, only to die yourself and do it again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your car, change your weapons, whatever it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>THE HIGHWAY BITES BACK</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/da6d3f44c628fca893834bda07795db0.poster.avif?t=1787688568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/da6d3f44c628fca893834bda07795db0.webm?t=1787688568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930190/extras/da6d3f44c628fca893834bda07795db0.mp4?t=1787688568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The road's cluttered with dead and debris alike.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Both will kill ya as quick as a breath,</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Never take your eyes 